{"agency_id": "inland-revenue-department", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aoJKYFn9YHY", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:36+00:00", "content": "Inland Revenue Te Tari Taake   Momo Whakahaere   Entity types (part 2)\n\nThe Momo Whakahaere kauhau (presentations) are an introduction to taxes for whānau Māori trusts. Part 2 explores the Māori Authority Account (MACA), making distributions to your members and how to record these.\n\nMore information:\nWatch Momo Whakahaere Part 1 to recap: \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hliw4XV8iQs\n\nFind out more about Māori Authority credit account (MACA):\nhttps://www.ird.govt.nz/income-tax/income-tax-for-businesses-and-organisations/income-tax-for-maori-authorities/maori-authority-credit-accounts-maca\n\nLearn more about how we can help you and your whānau:\nhttps://www.ird.govt.nz/maori\n\nAsk for guidance from your local Kaitakawaenga Māori:\nhttps://www.ird.govt.nz/contactus/kaitakawaenga-maori", "content_hash": "7511eca1dc21768ad976a9db2960cee1fa72841136d7fe85d59b83219db170e6", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCnJlxJNDqh_DxdTXVonuF3A", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCnJlxJNDqh_DxdTXVonuF3A", "source_id": "inland-revenue-department-youtube-2e471178", "video_id": "aoJKYFn9YHY"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-02-16T20:36:24+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-02\\aa67bd13e8d51d771988fa44.json", "record_id": "youtube:aa67bd13e8d51d771988fa44", "source_account": "InlandRevenueNZ", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@InlandRevenueNZ"}
